-        - ``DURATION_PERMANENT`` (−1): never expires automatically.
-        - ``DURATION_END_OF_TURN`` (0): removed when this method is called
-          (typically during the cleanup step).
-        - Positive integer *n*: removed when ``game.turn_number > n``.
